## Marzipan Bakery — npm config.
# react-helmet-async@2.0.5 declares a stale peer range (React 16/17/18) but is
# compatible with React 19 in practice. Until we migrate SEO to React 19's
# native <title>/<meta> hoisting (or to @dr.pogodin/react-helmet), we use
# legacy-peer-deps so installs are reproducible across team and CI.
legacy-peer-deps=true
